          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "iPad (grid no paginado)\n• Banner entre <View header> y <ScrollView testID='swatch-scroll'>\n• Mismo height 52pt · fill_container ancho\n• onPress → handleCameraPress (mismo handler)",
